{"page":176,"verses":[{"verse_key":"7:196","surah":7,"ayah":196,"ar_uthmani":"إِنَّ وَلِـِّۧىَ ٱللَّهُ ٱلَّذِى نَزَّلَ ٱلْكِتَـٰبَ ۖ وَهُوَ يَتَوَلَّى ٱلصَّـٰلِحِينَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"My protector is God: He has revealed the Scripture, and it is He who protects the righteous,","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"إِنَّ","en_gloss":"Indeed","transliteration":"inna","verse_key":"7:196"},{"pos":2,"ar":"وَلِـِّۧىَ","en_gloss":"my protector","transliteration":"waliyyiya","verse_key":"7:196"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"(is) Allah","transliteration":"l-lahu","verse_key":"7:196"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ٱلَّذِى","en_gloss":"the One Who","transliteration":"alladhī","verse_key":"7:196"},{"pos":5,"ar":"نَزَّلَ","en_gloss":"revealed","transliteration":"nazzala","verse_key":"7:196"},{"pos":6,"ar":"ٱلْكِتَـٰبَ ۖ","en_gloss":"the Book","transliteration":"l-kitāba","verse_key":"7:196"},{"pos":7,"ar":"وَهُوَ","en_gloss":"And He","transliteration":"wahuwa","verse_key":"7:196"},{"pos":8,"ar":"يَتَوَلَّى","en_gloss":"protects","transliteration":"yatawallā","verse_key":"7:196"},{"pos":9,"ar":"ٱلصَّـٰلِحِينَ","en_gloss":"the righteous","transliteration":"l-ṣāliḥīna","verse_key":"7:196"},{"pos":10,"ar":"١٩٦","en_gloss":"(196)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"7:196"}]},{"verse_key":"7:197","surah":7,"ayah":197,"ar_uthmani":"وَٱلَّذِينَ تَدْعُونَ مِن دُونِهِۦ لَا يَسْتَطِيعُونَ نَصْرَكُمْ وَلَآ أَنفُسَهُمْ يَنصُرُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"but those you call on instead of Him cannot help you or even help themselves.’","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"And those whom","transliteration":"wa-alladhīna","verse_key":"7:197"},{"pos":2,"ar":"تَدْعُونَ","en_gloss":"you invoke","transliteration":"tadʿūna","verse_key":"7:197"},{"pos":3,"ar":"مِن","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"7:197"},{"pos":4,"ar":"دُونِهِۦ","en_gloss":"besides Him","transliteration":"dūnihi","verse_key":"7:197"},{"pos":5,"ar":"لَا","en_gloss":"not","transliteration":"lā","verse_key":"7:197"},{"pos":6,"ar":"يَسْتَطِيعُونَ","en_gloss":"they are able","transliteration":"yastaṭīʿūna","verse_key":"7:197"},{"pos":7,"ar":"نَصْرَكُمْ","en_gloss":"(to) help you","transliteration":"naṣrakum","verse_key":"7:197"},{"pos":8,"ar":"وَلَآ","en_gloss":"and not","transliteration":"walā","verse_key":"7:197"},{"pos":9,"ar":"أَنفُسَهُمْ","en_gloss":"themselves","transliteration":"anfusahum","verse_key":"7:197"},{"pos":10,"ar":"يَنصُرُونَ","en_gloss":"can they help","transliteration":"yanṣurūna","verse_key":"7:197"},{"pos":11,"ar":"١٩٧","en_gloss":"(197)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"7:197"}]},{"verse_key":"7:198","surah":7,"ayah":198,"ar_uthmani":"وَإِن تَدْعُوهُمْ إِلَى ٱلْهُدَىٰ لَا يَسْمَعُوا۟ ۖ وَتَرَىٰهُمْ يَنظُرُونَ إِلَيْكَ وَهُمْ لَا يُبْصِرُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"If you [believers] call such people to guidance, they do not hear. You [Prophet] may observe them looking at you, but they can-not see.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَإِن","en_gloss":"And if","transliteration":"wa-in","verse_key":"7:198"},{"pos":2,"ar":"تَدْعُوهُمْ","en_gloss":"you call them","transliteration":"tadʿūhum","verse_key":"7:198"},{"pos":3,"ar":"إِلَى","en_gloss":"to","transliteration":"ilā","verse_key":"7:198"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ٱلْهُدَىٰ","en_gloss":"the guidance","transliteration":"l-hudā","verse_key":"7:198"},{"pos":5,"ar":"لَا","en_gloss":"not","transliteration":"lā","verse_key":"7:198"},{"pos":6,"ar":"يَسْمَعُوا۟ ۖ","en_gloss":"do they not","transliteration":"yasmaʿū","verse_key":"7:198"},{"pos":7,"ar":"وَتَرَىٰهُمْ","en_gloss":"And you see them","transliteration":"watarāhum","verse_key":"7:198"},{"pos":8,"ar":"يَنظُرُونَ","en_gloss":"looking","transliteration":"yanẓurūna","verse_key":"7:198"},{"pos":9,"ar":"إِلَيْكَ","en_gloss":"at you","transliteration":"ilayka","verse_key":"7:198"},{"pos":10,"ar":"وَهُمْ","en_gloss":"but they ","transliteration":"wahum","verse_key":"7:198"},{"pos":11,"ar":"لَا","en_gloss":"not","transliteration":"lā","verse_key":"7:198"},{"pos":12,"ar":"يُبْصِرُونَ","en_gloss":"(do) they see","transliteration":"yub'ṣirūna","verse_key":"7:198"},{"pos":13,"ar":"١٩٨","en_gloss":"(198)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"7:198"}]},{"verse_key":"7:199","surah":7,"ayah":199,"ar_uthmani":"خُذِ ٱلْعَفْوَ وَأْمُرْ بِٱلْعُرْفِ وَأَعْرِضْ عَنِ ٱلْجَـٰهِلِينَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Be tolerant and command what is right: pay no attention to foolish people.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"خُذِ","en_gloss":"Hold","transliteration":"khudhi","verse_key":"7:199"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱلْعَفْوَ","en_gloss":"(to) forgiveness","transliteration":"l-ʿafwa","verse_key":"7:199"},{"pos":3,"ar":"وَأْمُرْ","en_gloss":"and enjoin","transliteration":"wamur","verse_key":"7:199"},{"pos":4,"ar":"بِٱلْعُرْفِ","en_gloss":"the good","transliteration":"bil-ʿur'fi","verse_key":"7:199"},{"pos":5,"ar":"وَأَعْرِضْ","en_gloss":"and turn away","transliteration":"wa-aʿriḍ","verse_key":"7:199"},{"pos":6,"ar":"عَنِ","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"ʿani","verse_key":"7:199"},{"pos":7,"ar":"ٱلْجَـٰهِلِينَ","en_gloss":"the ignorant","transliteration":"l-jāhilīna","verse_key":"7:199"},{"pos":8,"ar":"١٩٩","en_gloss":"(199)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"7:199"}]},{"verse_key":"7:200","surah":7,"ayah":200,"ar_uthmani":"وَإِمَّا يَنزَغَنَّكَ مِنَ ٱلشَّيْطَـٰنِ نَزْغٌ فَٱسْتَعِذْ بِٱللَّهِ ۚ إِنَّهُۥ سَمِيعٌ عَلِيمٌ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"If Satan should prompt you to do something, seek refuge with God- He is all hearing, all knowing-","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَإِمَّا","en_gloss":"And if","transliteration":"wa-immā","verse_key":"7:200"},{"pos":2,"ar":"يَنزَغَنَّكَ","en_gloss":"an evil suggestion comes to you","transliteration":"yanzaghannaka","verse_key":"7:200"},{"pos":3,"ar":"مِنَ","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"mina","verse_key":"7:200"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ٱلشَّيْطَـٰنِ","en_gloss":"[the] Shaitaan","transliteration":"l-shayṭāni","verse_key":"7:200"},{"pos":5,"ar":"نَزْغٌۭ","en_gloss":"[an evil suggestion]","transliteration":"nazghun","verse_key":"7:200"},{"pos":6,"ar":"فَٱسْتَعِذْ","en_gloss":"then seek refuge","transliteration":"fa-is'taʿidh","verse_key":"7:200"},{"pos":7,"ar":"بِٱللَّهِ ۚ","en_gloss":"in Allah","transliteration":"bil-lahi","verse_key":"7:200"},{"pos":8,"ar":"إِنَّهُۥ","en_gloss":"Indeed, He","transliteration":"innahu","verse_key":"7:200"},{"pos":9,"ar":"سَمِيعٌ","en_gloss":"(is) All-Hearing","transliteration":"samīʿun","verse_key":"7:200"},{"pos":10,"ar":"عَلِيمٌ","en_gloss":"All-Knowing","transliteration":"ʿalīmun","verse_key":"7:200"},{"pos":11,"ar":"٢٠٠","en_gloss":"(200)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"7:200"}]},{"verse_key":"7:201","surah":7,"ayah":201,"ar_uthmani":"إِنَّ ٱلَّذِينَ ٱتَّقَوْا۟ إِذَا مَسَّهُمْ طَـٰٓئِفٌ مِّنَ ٱلشَّيْطَـٰنِ تَذَكَّرُوا۟ فَإِذَا هُم مُّبْصِرُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"those who are aware of God think of Him when Satan prompts them to do something and immediately they can see [straight];","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"إِنَّ","en_gloss":"Indeed","transliteration":"inna","verse_key":"7:201"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"those who","transliteration":"alladhīna","verse_key":"7:201"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ٱتَّقَوْا۟","en_gloss":"fear (Allah)","transliteration":"ittaqaw","verse_key":"7:201"},{"pos":4,"ar":"إِذَا","en_gloss":"when","transliteration":"idhā","verse_key":"7:201"},{"pos":5,"ar":"مَسَّهُمْ","en_gloss":"touches them","transliteration":"massahum","verse_key":"7:201"},{"pos":6,"ar":"طَـٰٓئِفٌۭ","en_gloss":"an evil thought","transliteration":"ṭāifun","verse_key":"7:201"},{"pos":7,"ar":"مِّنَ","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"mina","verse_key":"7:201"},{"pos":8,"ar":"ٱلشَّيْطَـٰنِ","en_gloss":"the Shaitaan","transliteration":"l-shayṭāni","verse_key":"7:201"},{"pos":9,"ar":"تَذَكَّرُوا۟","en_gloss":"they remember (Allah)","transliteration":"tadhakkarū","verse_key":"7:201"},{"pos":10,"ar":"فَإِذَا","en_gloss":"and then","transliteration":"fa-idhā","verse_key":"7:201"},{"pos":11,"ar":"هُم","en_gloss":"they","transliteration":"hum","verse_key":"7:201"},{"pos":12,"ar":"مُّبْصِرُونَ","en_gloss":"(are) those who see (aright)","transliteration":"mub'ṣirūna","verse_key":"7:201"},{"pos":13,"ar":"٢٠١","en_gloss":"(201)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"7:201"}]},{"verse_key":"7:202","surah":7,"ayah":202,"ar_uthmani":"وَإِخْوَٰنُهُمْ يَمُدُّونَهُمْ فِى ٱلْغَىِّ ثُمَّ لَا يُقْصِرُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"the followers of devils are led relentlessly into error by them and cannot stop.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَإِخْوَٰنُهُمْ","en_gloss":"But their brothers","transliteration":"wa-ikh'wānuhum","verse_key":"7:202"},{"pos":2,"ar":"يَمُدُّونَهُمْ","en_gloss":"they plunge them","transliteration":"yamuddūnahum","verse_key":"7:202"},{"pos":3,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"in","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"7:202"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ٱلْغَىِّ","en_gloss":"the error","transliteration":"l-ghayi","verse_key":"7:202"},{"pos":5,"ar":"ثُمَّ","en_gloss":"then","transliteration":"thumma","verse_key":"7:202"},{"pos":6,"ar":"لَا","en_gloss":"not","transliteration":"lā","verse_key":"7:202"},{"pos":7,"ar":"يُقْصِرُونَ","en_gloss":"they cease","transliteration":"yuq'ṣirūna","verse_key":"7:202"},{"pos":8,"ar":"٢٠٢","en_gloss":"(202)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"7:202"}]},{"verse_key":"7:203","surah":7,"ayah":203,"ar_uthmani":"وَإِذَا لَمْ تَأْتِهِم بِـَٔايَةٍ قَالُوا۟ لَوْلَا ٱجْتَبَيْتَهَا ۚ قُلْ إِنَّمَآ أَتَّبِعُ مَا يُوحَىٰٓ إِلَىَّ مِن رَّبِّى ۚ هَـٰذَا بَصَآئِرُ مِن رَّبِّكُمْ وَهُدًى وَرَحْمَةٌ لِّقَوْمٍ يُؤْمِنُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"When you do not bring them a fresh revelation, they say, ‘But can you not just ask for one?’ Say, ‘I merely repeat what is revealed to me from my Lord: this revelation brings you insights from your Lord, and guidance and mercy for those who believe,","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَإِذَا","en_gloss":"And when","transliteration":"wa-idhā","verse_key":"7:203"},{"pos":2,"ar":"لَمْ","en_gloss":"not","transliteration":"lam","verse_key":"7:203"},{"pos":3,"ar":"تَأْتِهِم","en_gloss":"you bring them","t