gloss":"(203)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"7:203"}]},{"verse_key":"7:204","surah":7,"ayah":204,"ar_uthmani":"وَإِذَا قُرِئَ ٱلْقُرْءَانُ فَٱسْتَمِعُوا۟ لَهُۥ وَأَنصِتُوا۟ لَعَلَّكُمْ تُرْحَمُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"so pay attention and listen quietly when the Quran is recited, so that you may be given mercy.’","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَإِذَا","en_gloss":"And when","transliteration":"wa-idhā","verse_key":"7:204"},{"pos":2,"ar":"قُرِئَ","en_gloss":"is recited","transliteration":"quri-a","verse_key":"7:204"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ٱلْقُرْءَانُ","en_gloss":"the Quran","transliteration":"l-qur'ānu","verse_key":"7:204"},{"pos":4,"ar":"فَٱسْتَمِعُوا۟","en_gloss":"then listen","transliteration":"fa-is'tamiʿū","verse_key":"7:204"},{"pos":5,"ar":"لَهُۥ","en_gloss":"to it","transliteration":"lahu","verse_key":"7:204"},{"pos":6,"ar":"وَأَنصِتُوا۟","en_gloss":"and pay attention","transliteration":"wa-anṣitū","verse_key":"7:204"},{"pos":7,"ar":"لَعَلَّكُمْ","en_gloss":"so that you may","transliteration":"laʿallakum","verse_key":"7:204"},{"pos":8,"ar":"تُرْحَمُونَ","en_gloss":"receive mercy","transliteration":"tur'ḥamūna","verse_key":"7:204"},{"pos":9,"ar":"٢٠٤","en_gloss":"(204)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"7:204"}]},{"verse_key":"7:205","surah":7,"ayah":205,"ar_uthmani":"وَٱذْكُر رَّبَّكَ فِى نَفْسِكَ تَضَرُّعًا وَخِيفَةً وَدُونَ ٱلْجَهْرِ مِنَ ٱلْقَوْلِ بِٱلْغُدُوِّ وَٱلْـَٔاصَالِ وَلَا تَكُن مِّنَ ٱلْغَـٰفِلِينَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"[Prophet], remember your Lord inwardly, in all humility and awe, without raising your voice, in the mornings and in the evenings- do not be one of the heedless-","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَٱذْكُر","en_gloss":"And remember","transliteration":"wa-udh'kur","verse_key":"7:205"},{"pos":2,"ar":"رَّبَّكَ","en_gloss":"your Lord","transliteration":"rabbaka","verse_key":"7:205"},{"pos":3,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"in","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"7:205"},{"pos":4,"ar":"نَفْسِكَ","en_gloss":"yourself","transliteration":"nafsika","vers